    <string name="happ_youtube_title">Happ: YouTube routing profile</string>
    <string name="happ_youtube_help">Import and activate “CleanYourTV - YouTube only” in Happ for your subscription, then reconnect Happ. YouTube domains use the VPN server; all other traffic connects directly. Happ stays connected. Your existing server subscription is required. Provider-locked JSON subscriptions cannot import a routing profile; use Happ Settings → Proxy for selected apps → On and select only YouTube (or SmartTube).</string>
