    <string name="auto_tunnel_state">Auto VPN: %1$s</string>
    <string name="auto_tunnel_help">Open a selected app: send Connect to Happ. Leave for an unselected app or turn off the screen: send Disconnect. Configure a server and approve VPN once manually. Choose apps in Apps for Auto VPN and enable the automation service.</string>
    <string name="automation_happ_failed">Happ could not accept the tunnel command. Update Happ, select a server and connect once manually. If the tunnel is still on, disconnect it in Happ.</string>
    <string name="background_cleanup_title">Release background apps after 5 minutes</string>
    <string name="background_cleanup_state">Release background after 5 minutes: %1$s</string>
    <string name="background_cleanup_help">On Android 8–13, request release of each ordinary app’s background processes 5 minutes after leaving it. Returning cancels its timer. System packages, keyboards, VPNs and launchers are excluded; preinstalled YouTube is included. This is not a force stop or removal from Recents: Android may refuse or restart processes. Closing cached apps can slow later launches. Enable CleanYourTV app automation in accessibility settings.</string>
    <string name="background_cleanup_unsupported">Android 14 and later do not let apps release other apps’ background processes.</string>
